1
00:00:00,486 --> 00:00:01,673
Narration: Teach one phone task.

2
00:00:02,221 --> 00:00:04,241
Narration: Reuse it with new words and values.

3
00:00:09,246 --> 00:00:13,117
Request: Teach. Order a Margherita pizza, from Brik Oven, on Zomato.

4
00:00:16,245 --> 00:00:17,398
EchoFlow: Okay, show me in Zomato.

5
00:00:17,398 --> 00:00:18,749
EchoFlow: Tap Done when you're finished.

6
00:00:18,749 --> 00:00:19,375
EchoFlow: I never pay.

7
00:00:23,502 --> 00:00:24,542
Request: Record my taps.

8
00:00:25,971 --> 00:00:27,879
EchoFlow: Okay, I'll record your taps myself from now on.

9
00:00:27,879 --> 00:00:29,701
EchoFlow: If I missed one, go back and tap it again.

10
00:00:30,926 --> 00:00:32,638
Narration: The lesson starts inside Zomato.

11
00:00:33,177 --> 00:00:34,853
Narration: We demonstrate the restaurant search,

12
00:00:34,997 --> 00:00:36,374
Narration: pizza selection, and cart.

13
00:00:37,372 --> 00:00:40,325
Narration: EchoFlow turns those screen actions into a reusable task,

14
00:00:40,479 --> 00:00:42,907
Narration: without a custom integration for this ordering app.

15
00:00:59,936 --> 00:01:02,283
EchoFlow: Learned: order amargeria pizza from brick oven on zomato.

16
00:01:02,283 --> 00:01:03,086
EchoFlow: I saved 10 steps.

17
00:01:03,086 --> 00:01:04,600
EchoFlow: You can change the item, restaurant.

18
00:01:04,600 --> 00:01:06,206
EchoFlow: You can see it in the EchoFlow app.

19
00:01:07,393 --> 00:01:09,975
Narration: The saved lesson is the starting point for each replay.

20
00:01:10,504 --> 00:01:11,872
Narration: We do not teach it again.

21
00:01:16,428 --> 00:01:19,389
Request: Order a Margherita pizza, from Brik Oven, on Zomato.

