EchoFlow: I won't pay.

28
00:01:45,373 --> 00:01:47,439
EchoFlow: Please check the order and pay yourself.

29
00:01:55,093 --> 00:01:57,238
Request: Get me a Margherita, from Brik Oven.

30
00:01:58,385 --> 00:02:00,575
EchoFlow: Okay, order margherita pizza from brik oven on zomato.

31
00:02:01,755 --> 00:02:04,364
